{"symbol":"LGT","yahoo":"LGT.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"LGT Global Hospitality Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","website":"https://www.lgtholidays.com","about":"LGT Global Hospitality Limited engages in tour packages operations and event management business in India. It operates through two segments: Tour Packages and Other Allied Services, and Hotels & Hospitality. The company provides customized holidays, corporate tours, group packages, hotel bookings, and visa assistance services. It also offers travel, meetings, incentives, conferences and exhibitions, sightseeing, visa processing, ticketing, and other travel-related arrangements for individuals, groups, and corporates. In addition, the company provides short-term accommodation and related hospitality services, including hotel rooms, guest houses, resorts, and other establishments. Further, it operates as travel agents and service agents for inbound and outbound tours. The company was formerly known as LGT Business Connextions Limited and changed its name to LGT Global Hospitality Limited in April 2026. The company was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Chennai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:36:53+00:00","quote":{"price":37.1,"prevClose":37.1,"marketCap":34.77,"high52":85.5,"low52":36.0,"pe":6.77,"bookValue":41.41,"dividendRate":0.25,"roe":18.1,"shares":0.9373,"insiders":71.95,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-08-26","2025-08-28","2025-08-29","2025-09-01","2025-09-02","2025-09-03","2025-09-04","2025-09-05","2025-09-08","2025-09-09","2025-09-10","2025-09-11","2025-09-12","2025-09-15","2025-09-16","2025-09-17","2025-09-18","2025-09-19","2025-09-22","2025-09-23","2025-09-24","2025-09-25","2025-09-26","2025-09-29","2025-09-30","2025-10-01","2025-10-03","2025-10-06","2025-10-07","2025-10-08","2025-10-09","2025-10-10","2025-10-13","2025-10-14","2025-10-15","2025-10-16","2025-10-17","2025-10-20","2025-10-21","2025-10-23","2025-10-24","2025-10-27","2025-10-28","